  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-purpose Cash Assistance to Refugees in Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme directly support 22,000 of the most vulnerable refugees through regular cash-transfers. Cash assistance to refugees covers their basic needs for rent, food, and essential items like blankets and heaters in the winter.
The programme is delivered though UNHCR, WFP and ACTED (for the third party monitoring activities).</narrative>
  </description>
